# cloak/travel: the hooded Travel cloak (OUTER, P2b wave 2), to the calves, the hood thrown back in a lump at the nape;
# the shoulder drapes and the cord are cloak/travel_front.
# It hangs behind the body (over it facing up) and rides the hang channel, so every clip's hang key moves it with the
# skirts: the hem sways by whole rows on the front and back walks (sway 6), kicks back on the side walk's contact frames
# (wide), flies in the run (flare), folds on a seat (sit) or a saddle (ride), pools on the ground (kneel, floor) and lies spread
# under a corpse (lie). 20 px across, 16 px deep at most, so the cloaked look's atlases stay near B10's budgets.
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# (LADDER-ARMOUR polish i2) (P4) every facing-U view repainted inside its own silhouette: a hood cowl whose rim curves down under the helm, its cast shadow, broad fold planes (a lit ridge plane, a mid plane, a shadow plane), two straight folds splaying toward a turned hem (work2/cloakU.py); the T4 back is no longer a plain tent, the Fjordfolk / Imperial backs no longer flat triangles
# (LADDER-ARMOUR polish i3) the T3 / T4 backs (facing U) hung higher and slimmer: three rows shorter above the hem and a
# pixel in on each side, so the calves and boots read below it (the panel: "no legs: a trash can").
# (LADDER-ARMOUR alloys i1) a T4 plate wearer's travel cloak (cloak.t3,armour.t4) is a hip-length CAPELET with a brass
# hem: the T4 step reads as plate (the back plate, fauld and greaves below it), the full cloak returns as T5's noble.
# (LADDER-ARMOUR alloys i3) the T4 back a SHOULDER MANTLE (cloak.t3,armour.t4): a rolled hood collar, three folds and a
# scalloped brass hem at the shoulder blades, the back plate and fauld showing below (the panels: "T4 U is mostly a big
# flat brown pack covering the torso").
# (LADDER-ARMOUR alloys i3) the T3 travel back (Fjordfolk, Imperial facing U) in three real folds: a highlight ridge
# (step 4) on each, the turn, a shadow plane and a step-0 crease low down (the panel: "almost all a pale cloak slab").
use person
body adult
role cloak travel
layer cloakBack
anchor neck
keys hang
sway 6
legend Q cloak 0
legend R cloak 1
legend S cloak 2
legend T cloak 3
legend U cloak 4

